  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kaunas VA s&#xE4;kerhet start</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kaunas W&amp;WW safety startu - Kaunas WWTP start, safety</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Idrifttagande av Kaunas avloppsreningsverk. VA-projektet i sin helhet syftar till att n&#xE5; f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad avloppshantering och rening i Kaunas. F&#xF6;r att kunna utveckla en fungerande driftsstart, rutiner f&#xF6;r riskhantering etc, tills&#xE4;tts konsultst&#xF6;d under idrifttagandet av verket. Detta till en summa av SEK 843 350.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kaunas Environment Project concerns investments for water supply and wastewater treatment. In order to develop operation procedures and safety routines, Sida will finance consultancy services during the start-up and commissioning of the new plant to an amount of SEK 843 350 SEK.</narrative>
  </description>
